<section id="A1.SS9" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.9 </span>Comparison to related work</h3>

<div id="A1.SS9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS9.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ A.9 Comparison to related work ‣ Appendix A Annotation Details ‣ Mind the Sim2Real Gap in User Simulation for Agentic Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> compares our work to prior studies on measuring the gap between LLM-based user simulators and real users.</p>
</div>
